{title: The Blood Will Never Lose Its Power}
{key: F}
{x_theme: blood, cross}
{x_source: chrd:the_blood_will_never_lose_its_power.chrd}

{comment: Verse 1}
The [F]Blood that Jesus [Bb]shed for [F]me, Way back on [C]Calvary,
The [Bb]blood that gives me strength from [F]day to [D7]day,
It will [Bb]never [C]lose its [F]power.

{comment: Chorus}
It [C]reaches to the highest [F]mountain.
It [C]flows to the lowest [F]valley,
Oh The [Bb]blood that gives me strength from [F]day to [D7]day,
It will [Bb]never [C]lose its [F]power.

{comment: Verse 2}
It [F]soothes my doubts and [Bb]calms my [F]fears,
That same blood dries [C]all my tears;
The [Bb]blood that gives me strength from [F]day to [D7]day,
It will [Bb]never [C]lose its [F]power.
